	<entry name="SeparatistRegiments/TargetAcquired" value="Target Acquired"/>
	<entry name="SeparatistRegiments/TargetAcquiredDescription" value="Increases the ranged accuracy of SeparatistRegiments against the unit. Reduces the ranged damage reduction of the unit against SeparatistRegiments. Ends after the unit is attacked by SeparatistRegiments."/>
	<entry name="SeparatistRegiments/TargetAcquiredFlavor" value="It’s a handheld targeting laser that is networked into the SeparatistRegiments information system, allowing for pinpoint strikes by other SeparatistRegiments forces."/>
	<entry name="SeparatistRegiments/SuppressiveBombardment" value="Suppressive Bombardment"/>
	<entry name="SeparatistRegiments/SuppressiveBombardmentDescription" value="Increases the damage and attacks pin down enemy infantry when adjacent to another Whirlwind."/>
	<entry name="SeparatistRegiments/SuppressiveBombardmentFlavor" value="Whirlwinds operate best in larger groups, laying down a rolling barrage that cannot be avoided but must instead be endured. Even when sheltered, lighter-armoured troops and vehicles are utterly devastated by the relentless rain of warheads."/>
	
