	<entry name="CommonDawn" value="Common Dawn"/>
	<entry name="CommonDawnDescription" value="Increases the influence."/>
	<entry name="CommonDawnFlavor" value="Separatists do not build basilicas or erect statues. Their dawn consists of factories where every worker knows why he is there. Their common cause is not a charter or a prayer, but survival and freedom. The new state’s influence is based on trust, not fear."/>
	
